  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "anna.kroll@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Jordan McInerney, MHA, Senior Managing Consultant</span></span></p>\n<p>Jordan consults with clients on innovative payment reform strategies, such as co-management arrangements, bundled payment initiatives and accountable care organizations. His expertise includes physician practice management and growth, network development, patient-centered medical homes and Medicaid managed care.</p>\n<p>After beginning his career with Medicaid, Jordan spent five years in practice management, during which he led the successful start-up and growth of a new Internal Medicine and Pediatrics practice. He received a Master of Healthcare Administration degree from the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill and is a graduate of the Administrative Internship Program at Duke University Hospital.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/content/stryker/us/en/joint-replacement/sps-blog.html\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">BACK</span></a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 25 2018 14:00:35 GMT-0400",
